/// The lane's own words, as the back office quotes them.
///
/// A till screen is not a back-office screen, but the back office reads a
/// till's audit log and draws its command matrix, so it has to be able to
/// say ပယ်ဖျက် and ပြန်အမ်း. Copied from `i18n.kite` rather than reached
/// into: the till must not gain a back-office import to lend a phrase.
